<title>USA: E-Z Serve names Callahan-Guion pres, COO.</title>
<headline>E-Z Serve names Callahan-Guion pres, COO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>E-Z Serve Corp Monday said it named Kathleen Callahan-Guion president and chief operating officer, a new position at the company.</p>
<p>Callahan-Guion was most recently vice president of Southland Corp 's Chesapeake Division.</p>
<p>E-Z Serve operates 702 convenience stores, 10 franchises and distributes motor fuels through 189 non-company operated retail outlets in 20 states, predominantly in the Sunbelt.</p>
